          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Something else? <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Write to us</a> or <a href=\"/pages/book-a-call\">book a call</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What level is it for?",
            "answer": "<p>Players who know the rules and how the pieces move, from your first rated games up to about 1500 online. A call can check where you are.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_4": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I need a real board?",
            "answer": "<p>It helps but it is not required. Every position in the lessons opens on a board in your browser.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_5": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I play only online?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Most students play online. The one rule is that the week's games are thirty minutes or longer, not blitz.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_6": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if I miss a live review?",
            "answer": "<p>Every call is recorded and added to the course the same day. Send your game link beforehand and Lena reviews it on the recording.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_7": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long do I keep the lessons?",
            "answer": "<p>For as long as the course exists. Lessons, recordings and the puzzle sheets stay in your account, and updates are free.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_8": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I pay in parts?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. At checkout choose three monthly payments instead of one.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_9": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if it is not for me?",
            "answer": "<p>Email us within 30 days of joining and you get a full refund.</p>"
          }
        }
